{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL0klMjBBbSUyMFdlZWtlbmRlciUyMCUyODIwMjMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"I Am Weekender","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/r1ZWAwt98OBKgiGeA7vE8iZqj7D.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ObMzUxnulghEZccgd9YK7zsSWS.jpg","description":"Wiz's Weekender (1992) was a film ahead of its time, both in form and content. It engaged with contemporary issues that mainstream media were eager to sensationalise. Consequently, it was branded with an 18 certificate and banned by both the BBC and ITV, never reaching a wider audience. For the past three decades, Weekender has bubbled just below the surface, gaining genuine cult status and influencing a vast network of creators. In the run-up to its thirtieth anniversary filmmakers Tabitha Denholm and Adam Dunlop interviewed people involved in the project. I Am Weekender is built around those conversations.\n\nRated 15 · Released 11 Mar 2023 · GB · Language: English · 56 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","imdb_id":"tt27837482","moviedb_id":1099318,"tmdbId":1099318,"runtime":"56 min","cast":["Jeff Barrett","Jeremy Deller","Tim Dorney","Dinara Drukarova","Bobby Gillespie","Anna Haigh","David Holmes","Jagz Kooner"],"director":["Chloe Raunet"],"released":"2023-03-11T00:00:00.000Z","country":"GB","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Chloe Raunet","character":"Director"},{"name":"Jeff Barrett","character":"Self"},{"name":"Jeremy Deller","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oY4JefvoVGvE0RNPFz4bQlbHq4l.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Dorney","character":"Self"},{"name":"Dinara Drukarova","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/toQCnbPVetvd42kL8qPb4biUCOT.jpg"},{"name":"Bobby Gillespie","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ylu0nMQqqqQNDeXqObQaQT8MY49.jpg"},{"name":"Anna Haigh","charac